000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          MCCPRTABND.
000400 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        6/20/90.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.     ABSTRACTS JOB LOGS PRODUCED BY MCXABEND
001000*
001100*    THE PROGRAM MCXABEND MONITORS ANY MESSAGES OUT OF THE
001200*    MENU SYSTEM.  IF ANY SYSTEM MESSAGES ARE ENCOUNTERED,
001300*    MCXABEND DUMPS THE JOB LOG TO A SPOOLFILE WITH USER DATA
001400*    OF "MCABEND".  THIS PROGRAM READS THROUGH ALL THOSE JOB
      *    LOGS AND ABSTRACTS THE DATA INTO A REPORT, SHOWING
      *    PROGRAM, DATE, TIME, RELAVENT MESSAGES, ETC.  ANY
      *    JOB LOGS THAT THIS PROGRAM DOES NOT "UNDERSTAND" ARE
      *    SENT TO AKRON FOR PRINTING. OPTIONALLY THE SPOOLFILES
      *    CAN BE DELETED.
009400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
009500 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
009600 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
009700 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT WRKSPLF-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFWRKSPLF
                  ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
                    ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT QPJOBLOG-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPJOBLOG
                  ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
                    ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.

010200 DATA DIVISION.
010300 FILE SECTION.
010400
       FD  WRKSPLF-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  WRKSPLF-REC                   PIC X(144).

      *------ NOTE: MULTIPLE 01 LEVELS IN FILE SECTION AUTOMATICALLY
      *------ REDEFINE THE RECORD.
       FD  QPJOBLOG-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  QPJOBLOG-REC.
           05  QPJOBLOG-REC-1-6          PIC X(6).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(12).
           05  QPJOBLOG-REC-19-22        PIC X(4).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(2).
           05  QPJOBLOG-REC-25-100       PIC X(76).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(1).
           05  QPJOBLOG-REC-102-111      PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(22).
       01  QPJOBLOG-REC-2.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(24).
           05  QPJOBLOG-REC-25-31        PIC X(7).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(102).
       01  QPJOBLOG-REC-3.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(24).
           05  QPJOBLOG-REC-25-40        PIC X(16).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(93).
       01  QPJOBLOG-REC-4.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(28).
           05  QPJOBLOG-REC-29-59.
               10  QPJOBLOG-REC-29-33    PIC X(5).
               10  FILLER                PIC X(26).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(74).

       FD  PRINT-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS PRINT-REC.
       01  PRINT-REC                     PIC X(132).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  LINE-CNT                      PIC 9(4).
       01  EOF-FLAG                      PIC X(1).
       01  FIRST-TIME-FLAG               PIC X(1).
       01  FOUND-PROBLEM-FLAG            PIC X(1).
       01  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG            PIC X(1).
       01  REC-ERR-FLAG                  PIC X(1).
       01  LOCK-PROBLEM-FLAG             PIC X(1).
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X  VALUE "0".

      *------ THIS IS THE LAYOUT OF THE OUTPUT OF THE WRKSPLF COMMAND.
      *------ A "WRKSPLF" IS DONE TO *PRINT, AND RESULTS IN A REPORT
      *------ WITH THIS LAYOUT.  THIS CAN BE COPIED TO A FILE USING
      *------ THE CPYSPLF COMMAND (RECORD LENGTH = 144), AND READ
      *------ INTO A PROGRAM USING THE FOLLOWING LAYOUT.
       01  WRKSPLF-RECORD.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-NAME             PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-USER-NAME        PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-DEV-OR-QUEUE     PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-USER-DATA        PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-STATUS           PIC X(3).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-TOTAL-PAGES      PIC X(6).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-CUR-PAGE         PIC X(5).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-CUR-COPY.
               10  FILLER            PIC X(3).
               10  SPLF-CUR-COPY-4   PIC X(1).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-FORM-TYPE        PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-PRIORITY         PIC X(2).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(2).
           05  SPLF-DATE             PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-TIME             PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-NUMBER           PIC X(4).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-JOB-NAME         PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-JOB-NUMBER       PIC X(6).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-QUEUE            PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER                PIC X(1).
           05  SPLF-QUEUE-LIB        PIC X(10).

       COPY COMMAND    IN COPYLIB.
       01  WORK-LINE                     PIC X(120).
       01  HOLD-MESSAGE.
           05  HOLD-MESSAGE-1-3          PIC X(3).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(4).
       01  HOLD-STMNT                    PIC X(5).
       01  HOLD-MSG-DESC                 PIC X(50).
       01  HOLD-PROGRAM.
           05  HOLD-PROGRAM-1-3          PIC X(3).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(7).
       01  LAST-MESSAGE                  PIC X(7).
       01  LAST-PROGRAM                  PIC X(10).
       01  HOLD-DUMMY1                   PIC X(30).
       01  HOLD-DUMMY2                   PIC X(30).
       01  HOLD-DUMMY3                   PIC X(30).
       01  HOLD-DUMMY4                   PIC X(30).
       01  HOLD-DUMMY5                   PIC X(30).

      *------ CFLIT PARMS
       01  FOUND-POS                     PIC 9(3).
       01  CFLIT-SEARCH-STRING           PIC X(30).
       01  CFLIT-STRING-TO-SEARCH        PIC X(133).

       COPY TDATECHK IN COPYLIB.

       01  HDR-2.
           05  FIL                       PIC X(4)  VALUE "DATE".
           05  FIL                       PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FIL                       PIC X(4)  VALUE "TIME".
           05  FIL                       PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FIL                       PIC X(4)  VALUE "USER".
           05  FIL                       PIC X(7)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FIL                       PIC X(8)  VALUE "TERMINAL".
           05  FIL                       PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FIL                       PIC X(7)  VALUE "PROGRAM".
           05  FIL                       PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FIL                       PIC X(7)  VALUE "MESSAGE".
           05  FIL                       PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FIL                       PIC X(5)  VALUE "STMNT".
           05  FIL                       PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FIL PIC X(12) VALUE "MESSAGE-DESC".
           05  FIL                       PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           05  REPORT-DATE               PIC X(8).
           05  FIL                       PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  REPORT-TIME               PIC X(8).

       01  DETAIL-1.
           05  PRT-SPLF-DATE             PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-SPLF-TIME             PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-SPLF-USER             PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-SPLF-TERMINAL         PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-PROGRAM               PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-MESSAGE               PIC X(7).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-STMNT                 PIC X(5).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-MSG-DESC.
               10  PRT-MSG-DESC-1-15     PIC X(15).
               10  FILLER                PIC X(60).

       01  DASH-LINE                     PIC X(132) VALUE ALL "-".

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  DELETE-SPOOLFILES-FLAG        PIC X(1).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING DELETE-SPOOLFILES-FLAG.
       0000-START.
           PERFORM 1000-HOUSEKEEP.
           PERFORM 6000-MAIN THRU 6990-MAIN-X UNTIL EOF-FLAG = "Y".
           PERFORM 2000-EOJ.
           GOBACK.

       1000-HOUSEKEEP.
           OPEN INPUT WRKSPLF-FILE.
           OPEN OUTPUT PRINT-FILE.
           MOVE "PLEASE ROUTE: JIM COFFMAN" TO PRINT-REC.
           WRITE PRINT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           MOVE "              JEFF BUNGO"       TO PRINT-REC.
           WRITE PRINT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           MOVE "              CATHY KALMAN"     TO PRINT-REC.
           WRITE PRINT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           MOVE "              DAVE PLUM"        TO PRINT-REC.
           WRITE PRINT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           MOVE "              WILL MCINTYRE"    TO PRINT-REC.
           WRITE PRINT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           MOVE "              BILL ROXBURY"     TO PRINT-REC.
           WRITE PRINT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           MOVE "              MARVIN MITCHELL"  TO PRINT-REC.
           WRITE PRINT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           MOVE "              LARRY KOLB"       TO PRINT-REC.
           WRITE PRINT-REC AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
           MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT           TO  REPORT-DATE.
           MOVE DATE-FORMATTED-TIME-OUT  TO  REPORT-TIME.
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM HDR-2 AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           MOVE 7                        TO  LINE-CNT.
           MOVE "N"                      TO  EOF-FLAG.

       2000-EOJ.
           CLOSE WRKSPLF-FILE, PRINT-FILE.

       6000-MAIN.
           READ WRKSPLF-FILE INTO WRKSPLF-RECORD AT END
               MOVE FILE-STATUS          TO  FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  EOF-FLAG
               GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.

      *------ SKIP HEADER AND TRAILER RECORDS.
           IF SPLF-CUR-COPY-4 NOT NUMERIC
               GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.

           IF SPLF-NAME NOT = "QPJOBLOG"
               GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.

           PERFORM 6100-COPY-SPLF.
           PERFORM 7000-ANALYZE-SPLF THRU 7990-AS-X.
           IF DELETE-SPOOLFILES-FLAG = "Y" AND FOUND-PROBLEM-FLAG = "Y"
           AND FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG = "Y" AND LOCK-PROBLEM-FLAG = "N"
               PERFORM 6200-DELETE-SPLF.

           GO TO 6990-MAIN-X.

       6100-COPY-SPLF.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  WORK-LINE.
           STRING "CPYSPLF FILE(" DELIMITED BY SIZE,
             SPLF-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACES,
             ") TOFILE(QTEMP/MCFPJOBLOG) JOB(" DELIMITED BY SIZE,
             SPLF-JOB-NUMBER DELIMITED BY SPACES,
             "/" DELIMITED BY SIZE,
             SPLF-USER-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACES,
             "/" DELIMITED BY SIZE,
             SPLF-JOB-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACES,
             ") SPLNBR(" DELIMITED BY SIZE,
             SPLF-NUMBER DELIMITED BY SIZE,
             ")" DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO WORK-LINE.
           MOVE WORK-LINE                TO  COMMAND.
      *    DISPLAY COMMAND.
           CALL "QCMDEXC" USING COMMAND, COMMAND-LEN.

       6200-DELETE-SPLF.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  WORK-LINE.
           STRING "DLTSPLF FILE(" DELIMITED BY SIZE,
             SPLF-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACES,
             ") JOB(" DELIMITED BY SIZE,
             SPLF-JOB-NUMBER DELIMITED BY SPACES,
             "/" DELIMITED BY SIZE,
             SPLF-USER-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACES,
             "/" DELIMITED BY SIZE,
             SPLF-JOB-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACES,
             ") SPLNBR(" DELIMITED BY SIZE,
             SPLF-NUMBER DELIMITED BY SIZE,
             ") SELECT(*ALL)" DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO WORK-LINE.
           MOVE WORK-LINE                TO  COMMAND.
      *    DISPLAY COMMAND.
           CALL "QCMDEXC" USING COMMAND, COMMAND-LEN.
       6990-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

       7000-ANALYZE-SPLF.
           OPEN INPUT QPJOBLOG-FILE.
           MOVE SPLF-DATE                TO  PRT-SPLF-DATE.
           MOVE SPLF-TIME                TO  PRT-SPLF-TIME.
           MOVE SPLF-USER-NAME           TO  PRT-SPLF-USER.
           MOVE SPLF-JOB-NAME            TO  PRT-SPLF-TERMINAL.
           MOVE "Y"                      TO  FIRST-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "N"                      TO  FOUND-PROBLEM-FLAG.
           MOVE "N"                      TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG.
           MOVE "N"                      TO  REC-ERR-FLAG.
           MOVE "N"                      TO  LOCK-PROBLEM-FLAG.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  LAST-MESSAGE.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  LAST-PROGRAM.
           PERFORM 8015-SPACE-HOLD-STUFF.

       7100-READ-LOOP.
           READ QPJOBLOG-FILE AT END
               CLOSE QPJOBLOG-FILE
               GO TO 7800-FINISH-PRINT.

      *------ TO IMPROVE SPEED, SKIP AS MANY RECORDS AS POSSIBLE THAT
      *------ WE ARE NOT INTERESTED IN.
           IF QPJOBLOG-REC-1-6 = "TIME  "
               GO TO 7100-READ-LOOP.
           IF QPJOBLOG-REC-1-6 = "  Job "
               GO TO 7100-READ-LOOP.
           IF QPJOBLOG-REC-1-6 = " 5728"
               GO TO 7100-READ-LOOP.
           IF QPJOBLOG-REC-19-22 = "RPY " OR "INFO" OR "COMP" OR "CMD "
               GO TO 7100-READ-LOOP.
           IF QPJOBLOG-REC-102-111 = "QDBOPENC "
               PERFORM 8100-READ-QPJOBLOG-FILE 3 TIMES
               GO TO 7100-READ-LOOP.
           IF QPJOBLOG-REC-25-40 = "Library list cha"
               PERFORM 8100-READ-QPJOBLOG-FILE 7 TIMES
               GO TO 7100-READ-LOOP.
           IF QPJOBLOG-REC-25-40 = "Specified record"
               PERFORM 8100-READ-QPJOBLOG-FILE 3 TIMES
               GO TO 7100-READ-LOOP.

           MOVE SPACES TO HOLD-MESSAGE, HOLD-PROGRAM, HOLD-STMNT.
           IF QPJOBLOG-REC-19-22 = "ESC "
             MOVE "UNMONITORED BY"       TO  CFLIT-SEARCH-STRING
             MOVE QPJOBLOG-REC           TO  CFLIT-STRING-TO-SEARCH
             CALL "CFLIT" USING FOUND-POS, CFLIT-SEARCH-STRING,
               CFLIT-STRING-TO-SEARCH
             IF FOUND-POS > 8
               SUBTRACT 8 FROM FOUND-POS
               UNSTRING QPJOBLOG-REC
                 DELIMITED BY SPACES
                   INTO HOLD-MESSAGE,
                        HOLD-DUMMY1,
                        HOLD-DUMMY2,
                        HOLD-PROGRAM,
                        HOLD-DUMMY3,
                        HOLD-DUMMY4,
                        HOLD-STMNT
                   WITH POINTER FOUND-POS
               END-UNSTRING
               IF HOLD-MESSAGE = LAST-MESSAGE
               AND HOLD-PROGRAM = LAST-PROGRAM
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
               IF HOLD-MESSAGE-1-3 NOT = "CBE"
                   MOVE "Y"              TO  FOUND-PROBLEM-FLAG
                   MOVE HOLD-MESSAGE     TO  LAST-MESSAGE
                   MOVE HOLD-PROGRAM     TO  LAST-PROGRAM
                   PERFORM 8020-FIND-MSG-DESC
                   PERFORM 8010-MOVE-HOLD-STUFF
                   PERFORM 8000-PRINT-DETAIL
                   PERFORM 8015-SPACE-HOLD-STUFF
                   GO TO 7100-READ-LOOP.

           IF QPJOBLOG-REC-29-59 = "Cause . . . . . :   Message CPF"
             MOVE "WAS DETECTED IN COBOL" TO CFLIT-SEARCH-STRING
             MOVE QPJOBLOG-REC           TO  CFLIT-STRING-TO-SEARCH
             CALL "CFLIT" USING FOUND-POS, CFLIT-SEARCH-STRING,
               CFLIT-STRING-TO-SEARCH
             IF FOUND-POS > 8
               SUBTRACT 8 FROM FOUND-POS
               UNSTRING QPJOBLOG-REC DELIMITED BY SPACES
                  INTO HOLD-MESSAGE,
                       HOLD-DUMMY1,
                       HOLD-DUMMY2,
                       HOLD-DUMMY3,
                       HOLD-DUMMY4,
                       HOLD-DUMMY5,
                       HOLD-STMNT
                  WITH POINTER FOUND-POS
               END-UNSTRING
               PERFORM 8100-READ-QPJOBLOG-FILE
               MOVE "IN PROGRAM"         TO  CFLIT-SEARCH-STRING
               MOVE QPJOBLOG-REC         TO  CFLIT-STRING-TO-SEARCH
               CALL "CFLIT" USING FOUND-POS, CFLIT-SEARCH-STRING,
                 CFLIT-STRING-TO-SEARCH
               UNSTRING QPJOBLOG-REC DELIMITED BY SPACES
                  INTO HOLD-DUMMY1,
                       HOLD-DUMMY2,
                       HOLD-PROGRAM
                  WITH POINTER FOUND-POS
               END-UNSTRING
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-PROBLEM-FLAG
               IF HOLD-MESSAGE = LAST-MESSAGE
               AND HOLD-PROGRAM = LAST-PROGRAM
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                   MOVE "Y"              TO  FOUND-PROBLEM-FLAG
                   MOVE HOLD-MESSAGE     TO  LAST-MESSAGE
                   MOVE HOLD-PROGRAM     TO  LAST-PROGRAM
                   PERFORM 8020-FIND-MSG-DESC
                   PERFORM 8010-MOVE-HOLD-STUFF
                   PERFORM 8000-PRINT-DETAIL
                   PERFORM 8015-SPACE-HOLD-STUFF
                   GO TO 7100-READ-LOOP.

           IF QPJOBLOG-REC-25-40 = "Error on device "
             MOVE "DEVICE RESPONSE CODE IS" TO CFLIT-SEARCH-STRING
             MOVE QPJOBLOG-REC           TO  CFLIT-STRING-TO-SEARCH
             CALL "CFLIT" USING FOUND-POS, CFLIT-SEARCH-STRING,
               CFLIT-STRING-TO-SEARCH
             IF FOUND-POS > ZERO
               MOVE SPACES               TO  WORK-LINE
               UNSTRING QPJOBLOG-REC INTO WORK-LINE
                  WITH POINTER FOUND-POS
               END-UNSTRING
               PERFORM 8010-MOVE-HOLD-STUFF
               MOVE WORK-LINE            TO  PRT-MSG-DESC
               PERFORM 8000-PRINT-DETAIL
               GO TO 7100-READ-LOOP.

           IF QPJOBLOG-REC-25-31 = "Record " AND REC-ERR-FLAG = "N"
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  REC-ERR-FLAG
               MOVE "IN USE BY JOB"      TO  CFLIT-SEARCH-STRING
               MOVE QPJOBLOG-REC         TO  CFLIT-STRING-TO-SEARCH
               CALL "CFLIT" USING FOUND-POS, CFLIT-SEARCH-STRING,
                 CFLIT-STRING-TO-SEARCH
               IF FOUND-POS > ZERO
                   PERFORM 8015-SPACE-HOLD-STUFF
                   MOVE QPJOBLOG-REC-25-100 TO PRT-MSG-DESC
                   PERFORM 8000-PRINT-DETAIL
                   MOVE "Y"              TO  LOCK-PROBLEM-FLAG
                   PERFORM 8110-READ-PRINT 2 TIMES.

           GO TO 7100-READ-LOOP.

       7800-FINISH-PRINT.
           IF FOUND-PROBLEM-FLAG = "N"
               MOVE "** UNKNOWN ABEND **" TO PRT-MSG-DESC
               PERFORM 8000-PRINT-DETAIL.
           WRITE PRINT-REC FROM DASH-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           ADD 1 TO LINE-CNT.
       7990-AS-X.
           EXIT.

       8000-PRINT-DETAIL.
           IF FIRST-TIME-FLAG = "Y"
               WRITE PRINT-REC FROM DETAIL-1 AFTER ADVANCING 1
               MOVE SPACES               TO  PRT-SPLF-DATE,
                                     PRT-SPLF-TIME,
                                     PRT-SPLF-USER,
                                     PRT-SPLF-TERMINAL
           ELSE
               WRITE PRINT-REC FROM DETAIL-1 AFTER ADVANCING 1.
           ADD 1                         TO  LINE-CNT.
           IF LINE-CNT > 60
               WRITE PRINT-REC FROM HDR-2 AFTER ADVANCING NEW-PAGE
               MOVE ZERO                 TO  LINE-CNT.

       8010-MOVE-HOLD-STUFF.
           MOVE HOLD-PROGRAM             TO  PRT-PROGRAM.
           MOVE HOLD-MESSAGE             TO  PRT-MESSAGE.
           MOVE HOLD-STMNT               TO  PRT-STMNT.
           MOVE HOLD-MSG-DESC            TO  PRT-MSG-DESC.

       8015-SPACE-HOLD-STUFF.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  HOLD-PROGRAM,
                                     HOLD-MESSAGE,
                                     HOLD-STMNT,
                                     HOLD-MSG-DESC.

       8020-FIND-MSG-DESC.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC.
           IF HOLD-PROGRAM = "CLBLOWUP"
               MOVE "** SEE BLOWUP REPORT TBLPRT **" TO HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF2817"
               MOVE "COPY COMMAND ENDED IN ERROR" TO HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "MCH3601"
               MOVE
               "REFERENCED LOCATION IN SPACE WITHOUT POINTER"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "MCH3401"
               MOVE "CANNOT RESOLVE TO OBJECT" TO HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "MCH1202"
               MOVE "DECIMAL DATA ERROR" TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "MCH801"
               MOVE
           "ARGUMENT ASSOCIATED WITH EXT OR INT PARM NOT PASSED"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "MCH0603"
               MOVE "RANGE OF SUBSCRIPT OR CHARACTER STRING ERROR"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF7306"
               MOVE "MEMBER ALREADY EXISTS" TO HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF9846"
               MOVE "ERROR PROCESSING QDGENDSP" TO HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF5140"
               MOVE "SESSION STOPPED BY A REQUEST FROM DEVICE"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "MCH0801"
               MOVE "ARGUMENT ASSOC. WITH INT. OR EXT. PARM NOT PASSED"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF5144"
               MOVE "ERROR DETECTED ON DEVICE THAT CAN BE RECOVERED"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF5216"
               MOVE "CHANGED FIELD IS NOT A VALID DECIMAL NUMBER"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF8067"
               MOVE "FILE NOT SENT TO ANY USERS" TO HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF4168"
               MOVE "ERROR IN DEVICE OR LOCATION" TO HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF5263"
               MOVE "REQUEST TO DEVICE FAILED" TO HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF9871"
               MOVE "ERROR OCCURRED WHILE PROCESSING" TO HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF4128"
               MOVE
               "NOT ABLE TO ALLOCATE OBJECTS"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "MCH3402"
               MOVE
               "TRIED TO REFER TO A DESTROYED OBJECT"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF5423"
               MOVE
               "NOT ABLE TO TRANSMIT TO DEVICE- SESS NOT IN SND COND."
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF5257"
               MOVE
               "FAILURE FOR DEVICE OR MEMBER"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF5170"
               MOVE
               "DEVICE SESSION NOT ACTIVE"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF9006"
               MOVE
               "USER NOT ENROLLED IN SYSTEM DISTRIBUTION DIRECTORY"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF3130"
               MOVE
               "MEMBER ALREADY IN USE"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF4550"
               MOVE
               "LAST REQUEST TO DEVICE FAILED"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
           IF HOLD-MESSAGE = "CPF3301"
               MOVE
               "READER ALREADY STARTED"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC
               MOVE "Y"                  TO  FOUND-MESSAGE-FLAG
           ELSE
               MOVE "** THIS MESSAGE UNKNOWN TO MCCPRTABEND **"
                                         TO  HOLD-MSG-DESC.

       8100-READ-QPJOBLOG-FILE.
           READ QPJOBLOG-FILE AT END
               CLOSE QPJOBLOG-FILE
               CLOSE PRINT-FILE
               CLOSE WRKSPLF-FILE
               DISPLAY "ERROR- UNEXPECTED END OF QPJOBLOG FILE"
               GOBACK.

       8110-READ-PRINT.
           READ QPJOBLOG-FILE AT END
               CLOSE QPJOBLOG-FILE
               CLOSE PRINT-FILE
               CLOSE WRKSPLF-FILE
               DISPLAY "ERROR- UNEXPECTED END OF QPJOBLOG FILE"
               GOBACK.
           MOVE QPJOBLOG-REC-25-100      TO  PRT-MSG-DESC.
           PERFORM 8000-PRINT-DETAIL.
